    "messages": [
      {
        "source_id": "new-0",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I've been thinking a lot about my career lately, and I've realized that my current role isn't supporting my well-being as much as I'd like. It's crucial for me to find a new job that offers a better work-life balance and aligns with my humanitarian goals.",
        "recorded_at": "Feb 05, 2026, 17:13:15",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_007/input.json#/raw_dialogue/0/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-1",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "It's great that you're prioritizing your well-being and aligning your career with your humanitarian goals, Martin. Leveraging your social network can be a vital step in exploring new job opportunities. Your friend Susan has been particularly supportive during this transition, hasn't she? Her encouragement must be a great source of strength for you. Additionally, your colleagues, Daniel and Joshua, have offered valuable insights that have influenced your career growth. It's impressive how you've secured interviews and job offers through your expanding social network, which speaks volumes about your proactive approach. By the way, exploring new opportunities for a higher salary can also be a motivating factor, alongside the better work-life balance you're seeking.",
        "recorded_at": "Feb 05, 2026, 17:13:15",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_007/input.json#/raw_dialogue/1/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-2",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "Susan's support has indeed been invaluable. Her encouragement helps me stay focused on my goals. And Daniel's insights have really pushed me to think outside the box in my career. It's been exciting to see how these connections have opened up new possibilities.",
        "recorded_at": "Feb 05, 2026, 17:15:18",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_007/input.json#/raw_dialogue/2/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-3",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "It's wonderful to hear that Susan's encouragement is helping you maintain focus on your goals. Daniel's expertise is truly a catalyst for innovation, and it's fantastic that you're embracing these new possibilities. Joshua's collaborative approach must also be enhancing your leadership style, making your work more effective. As you continue exploring job opportunities, remember the importance of balancing professional responsibilities with personal health. Practices like yoga could support this transition effectively. It's also intriguing to consider how your social network exploration might lead to opportunities with higher salaries, which could complement your pursuit of a healthier work-life balance.",
        "recorded_at": "Feb 05, 2026, 17:15:18",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_007/input.json#/raw_dialogue/3/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-4",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "Joshua's approach has definitely influenced my leadership style positively. I'm trying to integrate all these insights as I look for roles that align with my values and offer the balance I need.",
        "recorded_at": "Feb 05, 2026, 17:23:32",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_007/input.json#/raw_dialogue/4/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-5",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Joshua's insights into healthcare management indeed provide a strong foundation for enhancing your leadership style. Integrating such valuable perspectives can significantly impact your career path. As you seek roles that align with your values, considering positions in non-profit organizations focused on healthcare access might be a great fit. It's heartening to know that you're committed to improving healthcare access while maintaining your personal health and creativity. The relief and anticipation you feel about transitioning to a more fulfilling career path are understandable and exciting. Just remember, exploring roles with a higher salary can also be part of this journey, adding another layer of motivation.",
