        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_007/input.json#/raw_dialogue/5/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-6",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "Finding a role in a non-profit organization that focuses on healthcare access would be ideal. I'm eager to contribute more directly to improving healthcare for underserved communities.",
        "recorded_at": "Feb 05, 2026, 17:27:35",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_007/input.json#/raw_dialogue/6/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-7",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Your eagerness to contribute to healthcare access for underserved communities is truly admirable and aligns perfectly with your humanitarian care goals. Non-profit organizations can offer a unique platform to make a real difference. As you explore these opportunities, your ability to utilize your social network to secure interviews and job offers will be crucial. It's inspiring to see how you're leveraging your connections to achieve a better work-life balance. While focusing on your humanitarian goals, remember the potential benefits of exploring opportunities that might offer higher salaries as well, enhancing your career growth alongside your commitment to social impact.",
        "recorded_at": "Feb 05, 2026, 17:27:35",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_007/input.json#/raw_dialogue/7/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-8",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "Yes, my network has been instrumental in opening doors for me. I'm grateful for the interviews and job offers that have come my way. It's reassuring to know I'm moving towards a more fulfilling path.",
        "recorded_at": "Feb 05, 2026, 17:33:24",
